  <div class="row">
    <div class="customers__intro">
      <div class="customers__intro-text">
        <h2 class="customers__title"><%= _("We know more about your customers") %></h2>
        <p class="customers__lead"><%= _("Secure business with consumers") %></p>
        <p class="customers__text"><%= _("Our solutions let you look up personal data through a web interface or API, and give your company access to customer information that makes a difference.") %></p>
